<title>USA: Acadiana to repurchase shares.</title>
<headline>Acadiana to repurchase shares.</headline>
<dateline>LAFAYETTE, La. 1997-07-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Acadiana Bancshares Inc said Friday that it plans to begin a repurchase program for the company's common stock in which it may buy back over the next 12 months up to 10 percent of the consolidated net worth of the company, or $4.6 million, as measured on May 31, 1997.</p>
<p>Shares will be purchased from time to time in the open market.</p>
<p>The company said it plans to use the stock to fund its Stock Option Plan, and for other corporate purposes.</p>
